<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Store the party inventory on a placeable
NOTE: As with all commands that add items to a container, this command will reset the container (placeable)
to interactive not matter it's previous state.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>Equipped items are not affected. To store them, unequip them before using this function.
</p>
